Subject: [PATCH 3399/3799] soh: rename D_8088103C -> sTrapEnvColor

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the env colour BgHakaTrap_Draw binds
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_Trap/z_bg_haka_trap.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_Trap/z_bg_haka_trap.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_Trap/z_bg_haka_trap.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_Trap/z_bg_haka_trap.c
